[FFFFFF][55C05A]AEC Garage[-][FFFFFF]
[DECEA3]Part 2 — Vehicle modifiers[-][FFFFFF]

[9BD65A]Workshop[-][FFFFFF]
Craft the [DECEA3]AEC Modifier Bench[-][FFFFFF]. It is used for AEC vehicle upgrades.

[5ECFFF]Available upgrades[-][FFFFFF]
• lower fuel consumption;
• stronger headlights;
• more damage to entities or blocks;
• higher torque and top speed;
• larger fuel tank;
• less collision damage to the vehicle.

[DECEA3]Installation[-][FFFFFF]
Place modules in compatible vehicle modification slots. Higher tiers cost more, so choose upgrades for the vehicle’s role.[-]
